WEBVTT

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:30.656
Wind's so heavy, the bees can't fly

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:32.816
What can stop it now?

00:05:32.840 --> 00:05:35.136
What can stop it now?

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:37.016
Téh téh téh téh téh téh

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:39.176
What can stop it now?

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:41.296
Téh téh téh téh téh téh

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:42.856
What?

00:05:42.880 --> 00:05:45.016
So let's get a pumper

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:47.176
Drop the water from above

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:49.696
Send it here and there

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:52.096
this heat is hard to bear!

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:53.616
Get a pumper

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:55.776
Drop the water from above

